{"type":"standard","title":"Thomas Kean Jr.","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Thomas Kean Jr.</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q7791445","titles":{"canonical":"Thomas_Kean_Jr.","normalized":"Thomas Kean Jr.","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Thomas Kean Jr.</span></span>"},"pageid":1606565,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/de/Rep._Tom_Kean_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress.jpg/330px-Rep._Tom_Kean_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/de/Rep._Tom_Kean_official_photo%2C_118th_Congress.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3360,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1376219894","tid":"bcf33bb6-b6c7-11f1-9b5d-6925bfa960d0","timestamp":"2026-09-22T20:54:01Z","description":"American politician (born 1968)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Kean_Jr.","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Kean_Jr.?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Kean_Jr.?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Thomas_Kean_Jr."},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Kean_Jr.","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Thomas_Kean_Jr.","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Kean_Jr.?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Thomas_Kean_Jr."}},"extract":"Thomas Howard Kean Jr. is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative for New Jersey's 7th congressional district since 2023. A member of the Republican Party, he previously represented New Jersey's 21st legislative district in the New Jersey Senate from 2003 to 2022, serving as minority leader from 2008 to 2022, and represented the same district in the New Jersey General Assembly from 2001 to 2003.","extract_html":"<p><b>Thomas Howard Kean Jr.</b> is an American politician serving as the U.S. representative for New Jersey's 7th congressional district since 2023. A member of the Republican Party, he previously represented New Jersey's 21st legislative district in the New Jersey Senate from 2003 to 2022, serving as minority leader from 2008 to 2022, and represented the same district in the New Jersey General Assembly from 2001 to 2003.</p>"}